6.text:
PUBLIC RESPONSE: The five exemplars are all C V C with the V in 2 and with the
C in 3 taken from the set {b,d,t,w}.

* dad  d a d    V= a  C3 = d
* dab  d a b    V= a  C3 = b
* gut  g u t    V= u  C3 = t
* low  l o w    V= o  C3 = w
* cat  c a t    V= a  C3 = t

Hence the class is

V2 ∈ {a,o,u}  and  C3 ∈ {b,d,t,w} .

Ear, cop, ego, mom, ate all break the class:
ear  V2=a but C3=r∉{b,d,t,w}
cop  V2=o but C3=p∉{b,d,t,w}
ego  V2=g∉V
mom  V2=o but C3=m∉{b,d,t,w}
ate  V2=t∉V

On the five candidates

* leg  e g  V2=e and C3=g∉{b,d,t,w}
* dam  a m  V2=a but C3=m∉{b,d,t,w}
* rat  a t  V2=a and C3=t∈{b,d,t,w}
* car  a r  V2=a but C3=r∉{b,d,t,w}
* bin  i n  V2=i∉{a,o,u}

is the only member of the set that meets the V2/C3 requirement.
In particular leg, e.g. A. leg, is a clear non-member of the class,
the class being exemplified in the list by rat.

